; spawn1 — spawn + chan lifecycle + atom ops.
; The spawned body is a bare `ret`, which enqueues 0 to the result chan and
; closes it; a dequeue after the close yields the sentinel 0. Atoms exercise
; set/get/fetch-add/cas. Expected output (8 lines):
;   0, 0, <chan>, 5, 9, 1, 0, 77
'spaw spawn c!
c dequeue print
c dequeue print
c print
5 atomic a!
a atomic_get print
a 9 atomic_set
a 3 atomic_add print
a 12 77 cas print
a 12 78 cas print
a atomic_get print
ret
spaw: ret
